lign=\"right\">Time</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"right\">2 - 4</td>\n<td align=\"right\">10+</td>\n<td align=\"right\">90m</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>","updatedAt":"2021-10-03T17:42:22.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"chentsulin/awesome-graphql","categoryHTML":"<h2>Style Guides</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Shopify/graphql-design-tutorial\">Shopify GraphQL Design Tutorial</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/Shopify/graphql-design-tutorial\" style=\"text-decoration:none;top: -2px;position: relative;margin-left:4px;margin-right:4px;font-weight:400;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;font-size: 11px;font-family: Verdana, Geneva, DejaVu Sans,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 4px 4px 6px;background: #555;border-top-left-radius: 4px;border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;\">stars</span><span style=\"padding: 4px 6px 4px 4px;background: #007ec6;border-top-right-radius: 4px;border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;\">1.8k</span></span></a><!--TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_START____{\"type\":\"repo\",\"stargazerCount\":1809,\"repo\":\"Shopify/graphql-design-tutorial\"}____TRACK_AWESOME_REPO_ITEM_END--> - This tutorial was originally created by Shopify for internal purposes. It's based on lessons learned from creating and evolving production schemas at Shopify over almost 3 years.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-03T17:41:50.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"chentsulin/awesome-graphql","categoryHTML":"<h2>Style Guides</h2>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/development/api_graphql_styleguide.html\">Gitlab GraphQL API Style Guide</a> - This document outlines the style guide for the GitLab GraphQL API.</li>","updatedAt":"2021-10-03T17:41:50.000Z"},{"awesomeListRepo":"chentsulin/awesome-graphql","categoryHTML":"<h2>Implementations</h2><h4>Miscellaneous</h4>","itemHTML":"<li><a href=\"https://github.com/n1ru4l/graphql-live-query\">graphql-live-query</a><a data-role=\"trackawesomelist-badge\" href=\"https://github.com/n1ru4l/g